  "title": "Old-Fashioned Giblet Stuffing",
  "description": "Giblet stuffing is easy with this old-fashioned recipe that makes enough for an 18-pound turkey. Just giblets, butter, onion, celery, and dry bread cubes.",
  "authors": [
